  "prefLabel": "Rev 2201.03 Basis of accounting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2201.03 \"Basis of accounting\" means when revenues, expenditures, expenses, and transfers, and the related assets and liabilities, are recognized in the accounts and reported in the financial statements.\n\nSource. #5455, eff 8-28-92; ss by #6808, eff 7-21-98; ss by #8687, eff 7-21-06; ss by #10652, eff 8-8-14; ss by #14027, eff 7-16-24",
